        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVEDNCOM, Fifth Avenue Single Cylinder Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grandeur made FAVFAVCOM Fifth Avenue Entry Door Lock Set features a large contemporary ball knob that will surely enhance any setting where a sophisticated look is desired. The Fifth Avenue Knob is both elegant and timeless and when paired with the matching deadbolt, you can be sure that this entry set will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. Forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware, it has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. A single cylinder entry set, it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Fifth Avenue Single Cylinder Entry Door Lock Set fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fifth Avenue Single Cylinder Entry Set:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Eden Prairie Knob Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-plate.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually<i>\r\n</p>",
